#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Low-overhead, idempotent Hyprland application-session restore.

The long-running mode blocks on Hyprland's event socket.  It never polls the UI
on a frame/timer cadence; a five-minute safety checkpoint is the only periodic
query, and unchanged snapshots are not written.
"""

